ent-WFRemadeBrute = brute
    .desc = A hulking thing armoured heavily in front. Bullets bounce off its face. Get round behind it.
ent-WFRemadeTwitcher = twitcher
    .desc = It jerks about, here and then there, and bullets seem to miss it. When it charges, you don't see it move.
ent-WFRemadeTwitcherOracle = oracle twitcher
    .desc = A rarer, worse twitcher. Quicker, harder to hit, and it hits harder.
ent-WFRemadeHunter = hunter
    .desc = Shoot it, cut it, and it gets back up. Burn it, or take its head off and be sure.
ent-WFRemadeMender = mender
    .desc = Pale, and too quiet. Whatever you cut off it, it wants back.
ent-WFRemadeDivider = divider
    .desc = It is a great many things pretending to be one. When it comes apart, the pieces come for your face.
ent-WFRemadeDividerArm = divider arm
    .desc = A severed arm that crawls. It jumps at your face and hangs on.
ent-WFRemadeDividerLeg = divider leg
    .desc = A severed leg that kicks. It hits hard and bounces away.
ent-WFRemadeDividerHead = divider head
    .desc = A head on a nest of tentacles. It wants your neck.
ent-WFRemadeTripod = tripod
    .desc = A huge thing on three legs. It lashes its tongue across the room and drags you in.
ent-WFRemadeUndying = the Undying
    .desc = It walks slowly and it does not stop. Pull it apart and run, but it forms again a minute later. It stays down if you burn it while it lies there, or drag it onto a powered stasis bed. It also dies for good when the Monolith that made it is destroyed.
ent-WFRemadeInfectorEnhanced = enhanced infector
    .desc = A bigger infector that fights back. It turns a corpse in half the time.

wf-remade-elite-limb-tongue = tongue

wf-remade-elite-swing-hit = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} strikes {THE($target)}!
wf-remade-elite-ram-hit = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} runs {THE($target)} down!
wf-remade-elite-blink = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} jerks away.
wf-remade-elite-taunt = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} roars and the others harden around it!
wf-remade-elite-taunt-hear = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} roars at you.
wf-remade-elite-tongue-hit = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))}'s tongue wraps round {THE($target)} and drags them in!
wf-remade-elite-impale = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} impales {THE($target)}!
wf-remade-elite-pounce-land = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} lands with a crash!
wf-remade-elite-pounce-hit = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} crashes down on {THE($target)}!
wf-remade-elite-latch = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} clamps onto {THE($target)}!
wf-remade-elite-twitch = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} twitches out of the way!
wf-remade-elite-lies-still = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} falls and lies still.
wf-remade-elite-down-for-good = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} lies still, and does not stir.
wf-remade-elite-collapses = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} folds up on itself.
wf-remade-elite-rises = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} gets back up!
wf-remade-mender-reaches = Thin tentacles slide out of {THE($mob)}, feeling across the deck for its limbs.
wf-remade-mender-reattaches = A tentacle drags a limb into {THE($mob)}. It knits on with a wet crack.
wf-remade-mender-gives-up = The tentacles of {THE($mob)} grope at nothing, then go limp.
wf-remade-elite-regrows = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} grows a limb back!
wf-remade-elite-divides = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mob))} comes apart!
wf-remade-elite-undying-arrives = A deep chill slides into your mind. Something that cannot die has come aboard.
